              "sectionSpacing": 8,
              "source": "\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.55;padding:0 0 16px 0;\"\u003eOpen a basket into an empty cavity. This lives on the \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eLot Management\u003c/span\u003e tab, alongside Release and Void \u0026ndash; every cavity of the die has a row here, whether or not it is holding a basket right now.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eCheck the die\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eThe \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eDie\u003c/span\u003e box at the top names the tool mounted on this machine, and the cavity rows come from it. Every cavity has a row, in the order they are numbered on the die.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9AA8BF;padding-bottom:8px;\"\u003eWHAT EACH COLUMN SHOWS\u003c/div\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003ePart\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; What that cavity is set up to cast \u0026ndash; locked, so a basket cannot be opened against the wrong part.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eBasket\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; The LOT on that cavity right now, and when it was opened. Blank means the cavity is empty.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003ePieces\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; How many pieces are on the open basket so far. Blank for an empty cavity.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12.5px;color:#9AA8BF;font-style:italic;padding:2px 0 14px 46px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eA cavity that has never been set up shows an open \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003ePart\u003c/span\u003e box instead of a locked one. Pick the part, then tell a supervisor so the die gets configured properly.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eOpen one basket\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eOn an empty cavity\u0027s row, press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eOpen basket\u003c/span\u003e, then scan the \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eLTT Barcode\u003c/span\u003e when asked. The row fills in with the new LOT the moment it is open.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e3\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eOpening several at once\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eAt a changeover, with a run of cavities empty together, press \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eOpen all empty cavities\u003c/span\u003e in the footer instead of working row by row. It is the same scan-a-ticket-per-cavity-then-confirm flow as always \u0026ndash; it just runs from this tab now instead of a separate screen.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"border-top:1px solid #172238;margin:2px 0 16px 0;\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9AA8BF;padding-bottom:8px;\"\u003eROWS THAT OFFER SOMETHING ELSE\u003c/div\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eAlready holding a basket\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; The row shows \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eRelease\u003c/span\u003e and \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eVoid\u003c/span\u003e instead of \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eOpen basket\u003c/span\u003e \u0026ndash; see the release guide on this same tab.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eOut of service\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; The cavity is Closed or Scrapped in the die\u0027s configuration. It still runs shots, and they still get recorded as scrap on \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eReconcile Shift\u003c/span\u003e \u0026ndash; it just cannot hold a basket.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9AA8BF;padding-bottom:8px;\"\u003eTHE OTHER BUTTONS\u003c/div\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eTool Config\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; Opens the die\u0027s configuration. Greyed out until a supervisor signs in with their own credentials at the terminal.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#3A2E10;border-left:5px solid #F4B343;border-radius:4px;padding:12px 14px;margin:4px 0 16px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;padding-bottom:4px;\"\u003eIf the die is wrong\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eIf it is empty or names a different die, stop and tell a supervisor \u0026ndash; do not work around it.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
              "style": {
                "fontSize": 13,
                "overflow": "auto"
              }
            },
            "type": "ia.display.markdown"
          }
        ],
        "meta": {
          "name": "Body"
        },
        "position": {
          "basis": "0px",
          "grow": 1
        },
        "props": {
          "direction": "column",
          "style": {
            "classes": "modal-body"
          }
        },
        "type": "ia.container.flex"
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "name": "root"
    },
    "props": {
      "direction": "column",
      "style": {
        "classes": "modal"
      }
    },
    "type": "ia.container.flex"
  }
